 text.append('**6. Several broad descriptors persist, but fine rankings and the small-class specificity remain exploratory.** Low-SOVI versus high-SOVI large-group differences, the lowest-service-loss/high-initial-service small group, and older-building versus more mixed-land-use contrasts can be considered for manuscript integration review, using the raw profiles and direction comparisons. They are descriptive joint patterns. They do not establish that built environment causes recovery differences. Fine differences frequently reverse, particularly where their initial magnitude is small:\n')
